Terminal & Shell

The terminal is where AI engineers live. Get comfortable here.


The Problem
You will spend more time in the terminal than in any editor.
Training runs, GPU monitoring, log tailing, remote SSH sessions, environment management.
Every AI workflow touches the shell. If you're slow here, you're slow everywhere.

This lesson covers the terminal skills that matter for AI work. No history of Unix.
No deep-dive into Bash scripting. Just what you need.


